{title: Wo Shaam Kuch Ajeeb Thi}
{artist: Kishore Kumar Gulzar}
{key: G}

{c: Verse 1}
[G]Wo shaam [C]kuchh ajeeb thi
[G]ye shaam [C]bhi ajeeb hai
[F]Wo kal bhi [C]paas paas thi woh
[G]aaj bhi [C]kareeb hain
[G]Wo shaam [C]kuchh ajeeb thi
[G]Jhukii hui [C]nigaahon mein
[G]kahin mera [C]khayal tha
[G]Dabi dabi [C]hansii mein ek
[G]haseen sa [C]gulaal tha
[F]Main sochtaa tha, [C]mera naam
[C]gunguna rahi [F]hai wo
[C]Na jaane [D]kyun laga mujhe
[G]ke muskura [C]rahii hai wo
[G]Wo shaam [C]kuchh ajeeb thi
[G]Mera khayaaal [C]hai abhi
[G]jhuki hui [C]nigaahon mein
[G]Khuli hui [C]hansii bhi hai
[G]dabi hui [C]sii chaaah mein
[F]Main janta [C]hun mera naam
[C]gungunaa rahii [F]hai wo
[C]Yahi khayaal [D]hai mujhe
[G]ke saath aa [C]rahi hai wo
